Subject: [PATCH 322/638] cef: expose network cookie scheme controls

Apply CEF's upstream services_network_2622 patch as a discrete prerequisite for configuring cookieable schemes in CEF network contexts.

AI_PHASE: chromium-cef-bootstrap

AI_STATUS: upstream-network-cookie-schemes-prerequisite-applied

AI_ASSUMPTION: CEF 52dac911 patch stack is authoritative for Chromium 124.0.6367.0 integration

AI_VALIDATION: build 16 reported missing NetworkContextParams::cookieable_schemes

AI_EVIDENCE: test-artifacts/-cef-bootstrap-20260724/16-libcef-static-after-blink-devtools.log

AI_DECISION_CHAIN:; 52dac911; 4369407e5f
